; test_rdma runs anywhere. test_rdma_hw copies between two machines' adapters:
; it runs when NX_RDMA_TEST names the other machine's server, HOST:PORT, whose
; key is in the file NX_RDMA_TEST_KEY, and each machine has an adapter this
; process may take; it skips elsewhere.

